{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L511","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:511"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Token usage statistics passed to the onUsage hook.\nExtracted from the RUN_FINISHED chunk when usage data is present."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Includes optional provider-reported "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cost"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"costDetails"},{"type":"text","value":" (see TokenUsage).\nKept as an interface extending "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TokenUsage"},{"type":"text","value":" to preserve declaration merging for\nthis publicly exported type."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"extends","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extends"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TokenUsage"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:511](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L511)\n\nToken usage statistics passed to the onUsage hook.\nExtracted from the RUN_FINISHED chunk when usage data is present.\n\nIncludes optional provider-reported `cost`/`costDetails` (see TokenUsage).\nKept as an interface extending `TokenUsage` to preserve declaration merging for\nthis publicly exported type.\n\n## Extends\n\n- `TokenUsage`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UsageInfo\ntitle: UsageInfo\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:511](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L511)\n\nToken usage statistics passed to the onUsage hook.\nExtracted from the RUN_FINISHED chunk when usage data is present.\n\nIncludes optional provider-reported `cost`/`costDetails` (see TokenUsage).\nKept as an interface extending `TokenUsage` to preserve declaration merging for\nthis publicly exported type.\n\n## Extends\n\n- `TokenUsage`\n"}
